    {
      "id": "claim_01a8bbbbc2084a51a9419e0c3ef90f5f",
      "statement": "Unlike the heartbeat loop (which clears stored cloud credentials and re-registers immediately on 401/403), sendCloudEvent does not clear cloud credentials on an auth or HTTP failure — it only logs; token recovery rides on the heartbeat's re-registration path.",
