      "statement": "The local webhook is configured on the Gateway screen via GatewayViewModel.saveWebhookUrl (trim + persist to gateway_webhook_url) and saveWebhookSecret (trim + persist; blank value disables signing and logs 'Webhook signing disabled', non-blank enables 'X-Signature' signing); there is no separate on/off toggle — a non-blank URL plus the passing consent/runtime gate is the whole dispatch condition.",
