      "statement": "revokeGatewayConsent() removes the consent version and accepted-at timestamp, resets isEnabled, gatewayDesiredEnabled, and autoStartOnBoot, and calls clearCloudCredentials() (drops gatewayId, gatewayToken, isRegistered), so both webhook legs stop immediately and cannot resurrect after a reboot.",
