    {
      "id": "claim_766f972e2d22491f9b69ea01f71e9037",
      "statement": "MMS messages flow through the same webhook path: MmsReceiver reads the persisted Mms row and calls IncomingMessageDispatcher.dispatch with source = SOURCE_MMS, so the webhook message field for MMS is the text/plain part body, falling back to the subject, then the literal '[MMS]' placeholder.",
