      "id": "claim_ae43e2f1565b4660a551b43bedeb5e23",
      "statement": "The webhook and cloud-event contracts are published in docs/api/README.md and docs/api/openapi.yaml (the /webhooks/sms.received endpoint doc, the IncomingSmsWebhook callback, the WebhookPayload schema, signature-verification guidance, and x-cloud-backend-contract for /api/gateways/events/sms) as the shareable spec for webhook receivers and relay backend implementers, with the versioning rule that openapi.yaml must be updated in the same PR as any endpoint change.",
